<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108707" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπολιμπάνω</span></b> , collat. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπολείπω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leave behind,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Pet.</u>
				2.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				10.139d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>leave over,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ ὑπολιμπάνεσθε</span>
			<i>leave</i> no <i>arrears</i> (uncollected), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHib.</u>
				1.45.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; <i>reserve,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερμάτιον εἰς τοὺς προστάντας τῆς
					σωτηρίας ἡμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					4.392.4
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr., <i>fail,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ νάματα ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					1.23
				</span></i>
			.</div>
